    Bug 2017831 - Account Hub: Fix issue where manual config isn't shown after a credentials confirmation. r=freaktechnik


    **How to Test**
    - Enter test@thurnen.ch as email address in account hub
    - Continue
    - Accept the redirect
    - Go back after you get the manual config form
    - Continue again
    - Manual config should be shown

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D286469

